Omit the optional time range for unrestricted Get and Scan requests.

HBase 4 decodes an empty TimeRange as an empty interval. Absence retains
the all-timestamps contract; explicit non-default bounds keep their wire
representation. Update the upstream protobuf expectations accordingly.

